  "releaseNotes": "Pins the specification for LC045's interprocedural gap before implementing it: two cases an implementation should make report, and five it must keep quiet — a callee that explicitly loads, one invoked twice, one after an escape, one over an included query, and a delegate variable. The design note gains the implementation shape found by reading the code. No analyzer behaviour changes.",
